  ],
  "text": "The water in your glass is older than the dinosaurs, and it has been drunk before. Earth has never made a single new drop of it. The same water has just been going round for four billion years. It evaporates, gathers, falls, collects. Then it does the whole thing again. One molecule in there has been in glaciers, in swamps, and inside other animals. Nothing gets filtered out of that loop. There is no exit from it. So yes. Some of what you just swallowed has been through a dinosaur. You are not drinking fresh water. You are borrowing it for a while. One of these every day. Follow so you do not miss tomorrow.",
  "voice": "802e3bc2b27e49c2995d23ef70e6ac89",
  "model": "s2.1-pro-free"
}
